      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "プラットフォームではなく、例えばある特定の国家が特定表現への圧力をかけてきているのなら、その国からのアクセスを制限するモデレーションが実現できるとよいと考えます。\n\nRather than a platform issue, if, for example, a specific country is exerting pressure on freedom of expression, then it would be beneficial to implement moderation measures that restrict access from that country.\n\nさまざまな外圧からサービス持続性を守るための運営方針と、ユーザーの利益との排反は、どこのSNSも同じく抱える苦しみです。だからこそ、サービスを持続しながらユーザーの利益をなるべく保つ方法を(ニコニコ動画のしているように)探って欲しいというのが、ユーザーである私の望みです。\n\nThe inherent conflict between operational policies designed to protect service sustainability from various external pressures and the interests of users is a challenge faced by every SNS platform. That is precisely why, as a user, I hope the service will continue exploring ways to sustain itself while preserving user interests as much as possible — just as Nico Nico Douga has been doing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-05-21T10:26:08.975Z",
